<section style="padding:3rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border)"><div style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.5rem"><h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2rem);font-weight:600;color:var(--color-text);margin-bottom:1.5rem">Why Partner with SDF Clothing?</h2><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Small-batch orders get the same in-house production as our larger runs — nothing is routed to a secondary workshop or subcontractor to accommodate a smaller quantity. You work directly with our merchandising team from tech pack through delivery, at factory pricing. GOTS, OEKO-TEX Standard 100, BSCI, WRAP, and ISO 9001 certification apply.</p><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Our 300-piece minimum sits above the 50-100 unit threshold some domestic low-MOQ specialists offer, but well below the 500-1,000-plus piece minimums typical of traditional bulk factories — a middle ground suited to brands past the first-sample stage but not yet ordering at full retail scale. Tech pack development, fabric sourcing, sampling, and export documentation are included at that minimum.</p><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Because small-batch orders already carry a higher per-unit cost than bulk production, Bangladesh's trade position matters proportionally more here: EU duty-free access under Everything But Arms continues through November 2029 despite LDC graduation in November 2026, and a 20% US tariff cap from late 2025 keeps landed costs in check even at lower volumes.</p><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:2rem">Ready to start? <a href="/contact" style="color:var(--color-primary)">Request a sample</a> or <a href="/contact" style="color:var(--color-primary)">contact our team</a> for a detailed FOB quote within 48 hours.</p></div></section>
